# dockyrd product

**Source of truth:** `docs/BRIEFING.md` (architecture, API, milestones, NFRs). Shorter index: `docs/project/project.md`, phases: `docs/project/roadmap.md`.

## MVP constraints (do not violate without ADR)

- One **Go binary** on the host (systemd): API, jobs, reconciler, metrics, **embedded static UI** (`go:embed` of `web/out`).
- **SQLite** only for control-plane state (WAL, goose migrations, sqlc queries). Postgres/Redis are **user services** in Docker, not app DB.
- **Caddy** (`dy-proxy`) is separate from the panel; full JSON config reload via admin socket — panel restart must not drop live traffic.
- **Docker Engine** via local socket (no SSH to own host in MVP).
- Auth from day one: sessions, argon2id, TOTP, RBAC, audit log, setup-token on fresh install.

## UI

- Implement dashboard against **`docs/design-index.json`** (routes, tokens, shared blocks) and artboards in **`docs/dockyrd-design.html`**.
- Missing screens listed in briefing **§17** may get new HTML wireframes under `docs/project/issues/<id>/assets/` — not a rewrite of existing artboards.

## Done bar for releases

Briefing **§19** (install script, zero-downtime deploy, self-update, no Radix in `web/`, no external font CDN from UI, docs set). Track milestone exit in `docs/project/roadmap.md`.
